Position: Chief Legal Officer / General Counsel / Experienced International Lawyer
Moreinfo: Experienced international lawyer and manager
- over 10 years in building and managing legal teams and projects;
- over 10 years of international legal work with leading law firms and clients;
- experience in Contracts; Corporate & M&A; Regulatory and Compliance; Litigation/Dispute Resolution; Data Protection; Intellectual Property; Banking & Finance, etc.;
- international team management: supervising/coordinating up to 5 teams of up to 12 people in 5 different countries;
- a good network of international legal contacts in leading jurisdictions, in particular, in the UK and the USA;
- entrepreneurial/founder experience: over 5 years of running my own legal practice, including performing or supervising basic operations, finance, sales and marketing, and HR functions;
- good listener;
- good writer;
