- Key Account Management (management of global and high value customers, client relationship management, CRM, cross sales).

Degrees in Psychology and in Diplomacy + years of experience perform my strong skills of negotiator, relationship builder and deal closer. This best fits for relationship management and building the trust and the confidence with clients. And this is the way for success and long term cooperation. 

MBA + years of experience in business management perform my skills of strong team player, manager of business processes and decision maker in highly competitive environment.

