candidate_text:
Position: Community Manager
Moreinfo: Community Manager at large scaled IT competitions. I worked in two directions: project management part and marketing activities. Responsibilities: 
- info partnerships with various Ukrainian tech communities for cross-promotion; preparation of promo content;
- content development for social networks (Facebook, LinkedIn), maintenance and moderation of Slack space (>20K members); emails preparation (>20K base);
- organizational support for participants and external experts involved: development of relevant materials (information, guides, presentations, etc.); online & offline meetups organization; collection and analysis of feedback;
- conducting 'customer support' through all channels;
- attracting external experts and opinion leaders to participate.

Web3 Community Manager
I was involved in building, scaling, and maintaining the community around the web3 NFT game. Responsibilities:
- development of the strategy and content for social media together with the team (Twitter, Discord, Facebook, Telegram);
- planning and conducting internal community events, mainly in Discord;
- influencer marketing: initiating work with influencers (YouTube, Twitter, and Telegram), preparing all materials for posting, briefs for the content, and conducting analytics;
- partnerships with other crypto projects for cross-promotion;
- synchronizing the work of the community department with the marketing department (so that the community content is on the same page with the influencers' and PR releases, emails, and LiveOps events);
- branded content across all channels: preparation of branded content plans for the community synchronized with external activities.
Looking For: Blockchain/Crypto projects to join :)
Highlights: I owned an educational project with 100+ active participants — a bootcamp for students and recent graduates on entering project management. 
I prepared both the creative part (ideas and visual style) and the program and accompanying materials; conducted informational partnerships with the relevant online communities so that all registrations (500+) were reached without a paid promo; maintained a Telegram channel, a support bot & Slack space for participants; moderated the event part.
English Level: fluent
Experience Years: 1.5
